(openable *)
~(opaque *)
(capacity *)    32767
(appearance *)
    There is a trophy case here.
    (list contents of *)
(prevent [take *])
    The trophy case is securely fastened to the wall \(perhaps to foil any attempt by robbers to remove it\).

